// OSRS npcs imported by tools/models/importosrsnpc.py. Models re-encoded by osrs2ob2.py with
// the npc recolours baked in; stats and level from the cache, the rest by hand.

// He stands in the timber yard north-east of Varrock, where 377 already has the fenced enclosure,
// the stacked wood and the timber walls - the place is there, it just never had anyone in it.
//
// OSRS gives him Talk-to / Buy-plank / Trade. Trade is left off rather than shipped dead
// (claude/dead-op-audit.md): there is no shop inv behind it, so the saw and the hammer are sold
// through the dialogue instead.

